{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49417","headline":"小重山 一 · 和凝","name":"小重山 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春入神京万木芳，禁林莺语滑，蝶飞狂。\n晓花擎露妒啼妆，红日永，风和百花香。\n烟锁柳丝长，御沟澄碧水，转池塘。\n时时微雨洗风光，天衢远，到处引笙篁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"和凝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49417.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49417","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}